# Never Run Unless Asked

Do **not** run scripts, CLI commands, seeds, tests, installs, or servers unless Guilherme explicitly asks to run them.

## Allowed without a run request

- Read / search / edit files
- Draft code and explain how to run it
- Propose the exact command — wait for him to say run / execute / go

## Requires an explicit ask

```text
✅ "run it" / "uv run …" / "execute" / "reseed" / "test this"
❌ silent `uv run`, pip install, DB wipe, git push after only writing code
```

## After writing runnable code

- Stop at the edit.
- Show the command he can run.
- Do not auto-verify by executing unless he asked.
